<title>USA: Federal Reserve business loans up in June 11 wk.</title>
<headline>Federal Reserve business loans up in June 11 wk.</headline>
<text>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED JUNE 11</p>
<p>(Seasonally adjusted, millions of dollars)</p>
<p> Business loans............819,200 up.....3,600</p>
<p> U.S. Govt securities......727,500 up.....1,400</p>
<p> Large time deposits.......560,400 down...1,300</p>
<p> U.S. commercial paper.....859,795 down...5,412</p>
<p> Financial companies.......665,867 down...4,103</p>
<p> New York business loans....46,621 down...1,003</p>
<p> Excluding acceptances......46,361 down...1,003</p>
</text>
